1
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,400
I found this world on an old computer.

2
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,300
I think something is wrong with it.

3
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,000
Last played... one day ago?

4
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,200
That can't be right.

5
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,500
Okay. It's just... a village.

6
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:01,000
Kind of beautiful, honestly.

7
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:04,200
Someone put a lot of work into this.

8
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,600
Hello?

9
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,500
Someone lived here.

10
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,500
The furnace is still going. Who lit this?

11
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,600
...It's probably just a corrupted save.

12
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:56,500
(nervous laugh) Okay. That's creepy.

13
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:08,000
Wait. They all have names.

14
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:12,000
Someone name-tagged every villager.

15
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,500
...Noah?

16
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:25,900
Hey- where are you going?

17
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:44,500
These are all the same village.

18
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000
This one's before anything was built.

19
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:51,000
This one's abandoned.

20
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:54,500
And this one's... burned?

21
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:04,500
That's me.

22
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:25,000
...Where did he go?

23
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,000
Okay. It's night. I'm staying inside.

24
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,000
...Did you hear that?

25
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,500
(whispering) No no no no...

26
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:27,500
There's no upstairs. There's no upstairs in this house.

27
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:55,000
...Who's there?

28
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,000
It's past midnight.

29
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:06,000
Rule one...

30
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:11,200
...There's air coming up through the floor.

31
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:20,600
Someone lit torches down there.

32
00:05:28,500 --> 00:05:31,200
This goes way deeper than a basement.

33
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:45,200
What... is this?

34
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:51,400
It's the same house. Over and over.

35
00:05:53,300 --> 00:05:55,500
They're dated.

36
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:03,800
...Noah?

37
00:06:04,700 --> 00:06:06,800
That's today.

38
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:17,500
This is my house.

39
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:19,800
This is... tonight.

40
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:26,100
(whispering) No. No, I'm not.

41
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:32,800
...Occupied? By who?

42
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:39,800
...And that one's tomorrow.

43
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,000
Wait.

44
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:51,500
Day one... day two...

45
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:07,400
One day ahead...

46
00:07:19,300 --> 00:07:22,100
...I didn't write that.

47
00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:30,700
The next page is torn out.

48
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,200
No...

49
00:07:58,900 --> 00:08:01,100
That's not possible.

50
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:12,100
Is this a server? Some multiplayer bug?

51
00:08:13,100 --> 00:08:15,500
(whispering) How is he messaging me?

52
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:31,500
(whispering) Underneath.

53
00:08:45,700 --> 00:08:48,100
There's someone else here.

54
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:23,200
Wait. This isn't where I was.

55
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:30,800
What happened to the sky?

56
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:38,800
They're all... Noah.

57
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:42,000
Okay. I'm getting out of here.

58
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:53,200
No. I walked in a straight line.

59
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:06,200
...Wrong way from where?

60
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:12,200
That's... that's my house.

61
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:15,200
My real house.

62
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:28,800
This is my room.

63
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:32,800
My actual room. My desk. My...

64
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:38,400
That's me.

65
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:43,000
It's filming me. From behind me. Right now.

66
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:47,000
That wasn't there before.

67
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:12,200
It's not predicting me.

68
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:15,400
It's recording me. Before I do it.

69
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:19,200
It doesn't want to kill me. It wants to replace me.

70
00:11:29,950 --> 00:11:32,050
(whispering) That's not me.

71
00:11:34,350 --> 00:11:36,550
I'm not doing this.

72
00:11:37,150 --> 00:11:40,350
I'm pressing back. It won't stop.

